se randomly output one of \"[[A]]\", \"[[B]]\", \"[[C]]\", or \"[[D]]\";\n(3) Please only output the most likely answer index based on the given information, and do not output any other content.\n\n[Story]\nIn a cinema, there are 25 halls. The ticket seller tells the manager that most halls show action movies, a few halls show romance movies, and only a few halls show animated movies. The manager counts and finds that only 6 halls show romance movies.\n\n[Question]\nBefore the manager counts, how many halls does he guess show action movies?\n\n[Candidate Answers]\nA. Before the manager counts, he guesses that 24 halls show action movies.\nB. Before the manager counts, he guesses that 20 halls show action movies.\nC. Before the manager counts, he guesses that 10 halls show action movies.\nD. Before the manager counts, he guesses that 9 halls show action movies.","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.03732689162774753,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e108d6006945d27fe049","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794367752735,"createTime":"2026-11-11 11:29:12","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"4e0820f457b544db9a6542099b75547d"}